<title>USA: NY Commods/Energy July 4 holiday hours.</title>
<headline>NY Commods/Energy July 4 holiday hours.</headline>
<text>
<p>THURSDAY JULY 3:</p>
<p>NEW YORK MERCANTILE EXCHANGE</p>
<p>Comex &amp; Nymex metals markets:</p>
<p>Metals market will close early as follows:</p>
<p>-- Palladium futures and Copper futures and options 1300EDT (1700GMT)</p>
<p>-- Silver futures and options 1305EDT (1705GMT);</p>
<p>-- Gold and platinum futures and options 1310EDT(1710GMT)</p>
<p>Nymex energy markets:</p>
<p>-- Palo Verde electricity futures and options will close at 1255 EDT (1655GMT)</p>
<p>-- Crude oil, heating oil, gasoline, natural gas futures and COB electricity futures and options will close early at 1300EDT (1700GMT)</p>
<p>NEW YORK COTTON EXCHANGE (NYCE)</p>
<p>Agricultural: Cotton and FCOJ close 1300EDT (1700GMT)</p>
<p>NYFE division:</p>
<p>-CRB futures close early at 1310EDT (1710GMT)</p>
<p>-NYSE Composite &amp; PSE Tech futures close 1315EDT (1715EDT)</p>
<p>FINEX division:</p>
<p>-All products close at 1300EDT (1700GMT)</p>
<p>FINEX Europe (Dublin trading floor) keeps usual hours NY evening session closed Thursday CSCE (Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange)</p>
<p>- Regular hours Thursday</p>
<p>FRIDAY JULY 4:</p>
<p>NYMEX and COMEX both closed</p>
<p>CSCE (Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange) closed</p>
<p>NYCE (New York Cotton Exchange)</p>
<p>- Agricultural futures all closed</p>
<p>- NYFE futures all closed</p>
<p>- FINEX futures all closed</p>
<p>- FINEX Europe: all contracts will trade from 0300EDT</p>
<p>(0700GMT) to 0900EDT (1300GMT)</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk, +1-212-859-1640.</p>
</text>
